3.2 FRACTAL GENERATION CORE

function NODE(seed, depth):
    state = GENERATE(seed)

    if depth == 0:
        return state

    children = []
    for rule in RULE_SET(seed):
        child_seed = HASH(seed + rule)
        children.append(NODE(child_seed, depth-1))

    return COMBINE(state, children)

FEATURES:

recursive expansion

deterministic regeneration

rule-conditioned branching



